# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  MAIN
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SETUP LEDGER  (Stocks > Setup ledger)
#  Every long MACD, TraderLion, RS 8-week, LBR, Trend and Gap setup in the loaded history, each traded with a stop,
#  a target and an optional time limit, off, one for all, or per family (the triple barrier: López de Prado 2018,
#  ch. 3, with the vertical barrier optional), then scored the honest way:
#    - results in R after costs, with each setup's own stop (10-day low fallback; clamped to 0.5-3 ATR)
#    - edge = the setup's forward return minus the same-date average of every uptrend name (does the setup
#      add anything beyond "an uptrend stock on that day"?), so a bull market can't flatter it
#    - one observation per signal date (names that fire together share the market), Newey-West t with lags
#      equal to the edge window (and, for E[R], at least the 75th-percentile hold), because trades overlap
#    - Benjamini-Hochberg false-discovery control across every setup x split tested in the run
#    - PROVEN needs t >= 3 (Harvey, Liu & Zhu 2016 hurdle for a mined factor), q <= 0.10, a holdout period
#      that agrees in sign, and a positive E[R] after costs
#    - tail share: how much of the net R came from the best 5% of trades
#  Universe: your list (today's names: survivorship and selection bias lift every row), or the whole market
#  from Massive grouped daily bars with delisted names kept (survivorship-free). Compare the two side by side.
#  Entry: next open, or a buy stop above the signal-day high (filled at the open on a gap). Inside one daily
#  bar the order of high and low is unknown, so a bar that touches both barriers counts as a stop, a gap
#  through a barrier fills at the open, and on an intraday buy-stop fill the stop counts only if the close
#  is at or below it (the low may have come before the fill).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

