# Zanger family (Dan Zanger's published rules): buy as the stock breaks out of a well-formed base with volume rising
# over recent levels, don't chase more than 5% past the line, sell fast if it falls back into the base, hold the strong
# ones. The base here is a testable stand-in for his trend lines: the prior ZG_BASE sessions, no deeper than ZG_DEPTH
# from high to low, within 15% of the 52-week high, in a name over its rising 50-day. The line is the base's high.
# zg:quiet is the same breakout without the volume, so the ledger shows what the volume adds on your list.
ZG_BASE, ZG_DEPTH, ZG_VOL, ZG_CHASE = 15, 0.15, 1.5, 0.05
